{
    "title": "AdaptedMind Math",
    "description": "Embark on an exciting math adventure with AdaptedMind, where learning becomes an immersive journey! Designed for students in grades PreK-8, AdaptedMind transforms math education into a captivating experience filled with interactive games, engaging puzzles, and challenges that adapt to each child's learning pace. Every problem is a mystery to solve, and every achievement unlocks new levels of excitement, fostering not just math skills but a lifelong love of learning. At AdaptedMind, real learning is delightful.\r\n\r\nWHY CHOOSE ADAPTEDMIND'S MATH PROGRAM?\r\n\r\nPretest Assessment: Start your child\u2019s learning journey with a pretest that evaluates their math skills, allowing us to create a customized learning plan based on their strengths and areas for improvement.\r\n\r\nPersonalized Learning: Our adaptive technology crafts a unique learning path for each child, catering to their needs and pace. Whether they need reinforcement or a challenge, we\u2019ve got them covered.\r\n\r\nFun & Engaging Content: Explore our extensive library of interactive math lessons, practice exercises, worksheets, and games that bring math concepts to life through enjoyable activities.\r\n\r\nExplanatory Videos: Access instructional videos led by experienced educators, offering visual explanations for every problem and enhancing understanding through our concept explanation videos.\r\n\r\nProgress Tracking: Easily monitor your child\u2019s progress with detailed reports and analytics, keeping you informed about their strengths and areas needing improvement, so you can provide targeted support.\r\n\r\nProven Results: Join the 95% of our members who experience increased math confidence and ability. With AdaptedMind, your child gains the confidence to excel in math and beyond. Whether they\u2019re starting their math journey or mastering advanced concepts, we\u2019re here to support their mathematical growth.\r\n\r\nSUBSCRIPTION DETAILS\r\n\r\nEnjoy a 30-day free trial upon signup. Payment will be charged to your Apple ID after the trial period ends. The subscription automatically renews unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://www.adaptedmind.com/info/legal\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.adaptedmind.com/info/privacy",
